              <h2>How to Check Any Kids' App for Hidden Tracking in 10 Seconds</h2>
              <p>
                Before downloading any app for your child on the Apple App Store or Google Play Store, scroll down to
                the <strong>App Privacy</strong> (iOS) or <strong>Data Safety</strong> (Android) nutrition label:
              </p>
              <ol>
                <li>Look for <strong>"Data Not Collected"</strong>, the gold-standard badge indicating the developer does
                  not collect any data from the app.</li>
                <li>Check <strong>"In-App Purchases"</strong> to see whether the app offers a single <em>"Full Game
                    Unlock"</em> (one-time purchase) or lists multiple recurring monthly/annual subscription tiers.</li>
              </ol>

